#: f4aeb02849e3451a9c66349edee5c534
msgid "DIY Camera Trigger using Relay"
msgstr "使用继电器的 DIY 相机触发"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:10
#: 2569cada2d0b44e7b47ecbc33f473b0e 426a684c921a440eab4be919a7c0ca04
#: 97030f0ab63b43629c7ce3772c72e17e bebff7c4d3824b7b980b1342d5e64969
#: d0662500161b4dcdb4e15c6bac51c5b5
msgid ""
"This guide is intended to help you modify a remote shutter release cable for"
" use with ArduPilot autopilots and setup the flight controller for "
"triggering the camera. This method eliminates the need (and costs) for 3\\ "
":sup:`rd` party triggering devices. In this specific example, we will use a "
"Sony Alpha 6000 (A6000) camera. This procedure may work with other cameras "
"however for this specific example, we will use a Sony Alpha A6000 (A6000)."
msgstr ""
"本指南旨在帮助您改装遥控快门释放线，以便与 ArduPilot "
"飞控配合使用，并设置飞控以触发相机。此方法消除了对第三方触发设备的需求（及费用）。在本示例中，我们将使用 Sony Alpha "
"6000（A6000）相机。此程序可能适用于其他相机，但在本示例中，我们将使用 Sony Alpha A6000（A6000）。"

