#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:26
#: 3a7e885f62b24599b41b04492a4ad63d 63646e9e98bc4ad686a903375dc27fbe
#: 6ba9e2bff55947848a96159e69088289 d57a715a98d2408e80afb27358ce1dfa
#: e764e5a3bb5a4152a2ab636ffc21ce92
msgid "Wire Stripper or Razor Blade"
msgstr "剥线钳或剃刀刀片"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:27
#: 00a731b25b044df1b14ba3e25ebf344a 80f8f59af03d487989ec4cfac2c2ceb9
#: af7bb00c3f6f4a45b0bea29110aa4ce8 b92464343d784fffb52c04e9ee844a0e
#: fe78ac6ecc4d466ba7b26050f10c2db8
msgid "Laptop with Mission Planner Installed"
msgstr "已安装 Mission Planner 的笔记本电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:29
#: 6b461951cb4242a582aa5a25daeb3abe 833b31dd50cb41b1993a807968b8e54a
#: 84977bd2abe84cfb9f5e2b0b0d8613a2 aa9f6b68276c4d7cb701c44cf6ce260a
#: f657922d9b8245eb97c2daa774f751fb
msgid "**Step 1:** Preparing the Remote Shutter Release Cable"
msgstr "**步骤 1：** 准备遥控快门释放线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:31
#: 3db37a593d4040b79b0cca41c2ab3417 7a457e49267e4a77aef7e8c64e160b9d
#: 9b3779bd328b45e29b421a00ff74eed5 ce74f0ef079c4e42bbd84bc8372acbb7
#: fed0ec95da654359afed8728b24fa6df
msgid "Trim the Remote Shutter Release Cable to the desired cable length"
msgstr "将遥控快门释放线剪至所需长度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:36
#: 1f31f7990ad8499cb1e99881bd8280b4 2f12f1e1dd5144eca83c6f8e8c0af5cc
#: 62b0f8ad2ccb4cb59cae61828a94c22d 8827a9d6deee4f5dbfaa0b7190d4ab1e
#: f1c4f711ae244acd98cf371cf028983b
msgid ""
"Strip off approximately 2-3cm of the black sleeve making sure not to damage "
"the 3 wires contained within the sleeve."
msgstr "剥去约 2-3cm 的黑色外皮，注意不要损坏外皮内的 3 根导线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:41
#: 0d488c81186d4e879ba589ddf6e378ac a0ddb874a2654061863b44404294bf38
#: afdf295f97b64764901ae6afeb599f9f b41522e000e543bab6855ae1293028db
#: e358292ee05042859c096012c1a7260c
msgid ""
"Remove approximately 3mm of the sleeves off of each of the three wires. You "
"will need to make sure that there is enough of the sleeve removed that when "
"the servo pin is crimped to the wire that there is contact between the pin "
"and the exposed wire."
msgstr "剥去每根导线约 3mm 的绝缘层。需要确保剥去足够的绝缘层，使舵机插针压接到导线时，插针与裸露导线之间有良好接触。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:46
#: 6bbc47c117cf4c26885938cfa13ce3c3 99378b4ba2d149a6bc19dff7a1ba1c15
#: a212d882925d492e8638777d9c1e5859 a2b4c577ba924615b32451c32d7d0665
#: bf764e0325914013b8e54d908fe2479d
msgid "The three wires have the following functions:"
msgstr "三根导线具有以下功能："

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:48
#: 75030c6ec2df4de492df2c2a084fb91f c99760abd3e64f9f8a5a2ff633c16a0d
#: ca9201588a2749d782d71a1e457b8d92 cc053833a6894a86b2cd290e2c6afff8
#: ed46496246f14883bea5a1083eb45d08
msgid "RED: SHUTTER"
msgstr "红色：快门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:49
#: 3a266fdd45ca47de8009d8a91f9a0e7d 3d156a7588aa4a7d8e8f6b07054a3b40
#: 44fb8a9d7cbf47bfa4acc786605b06a3 810180b6482f4d1aa5b6180beb9e1422
#: 986d35e1951f4938a872bd28599cc45e
msgid "YELLOW: GROUND"
msgstr "黄色：地线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:50
#: 4e2e39f292b54bc98476bd913ba9ef18 66a070701e964288b37083676bed5e6f
#: 91f7e74756a64e9b8ba4a599719ce25b b78c28ddfeb44148a8c7465e941289d5
#: b9e8d8ea643944bbbd65ce64ab80cda9
msgid "WHITE: FOCUS"
msgstr "白色：对焦"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:52
#: 14a78b888e814c1687ab18f0223ebca2 294a155c35bc4ef0ab85651257493ad8
#: 7336906461e04ecb908cab7aeefdd395 81acef9bd6374caf9504aea412bed69e
#: a7eddf92a8d84ffba6d50cb421d7ad4f
msgid ""
"**NOTE:** Your wire coloring may differ from this example. You can identify "
"which functions are controlled by each cable by connecting the cable to your"
" camera, powering it on and then shorting the cables in pairs to identify "
"which pair does what. For example, if you have a GREEN, BLUE and BLACK set "
"of wires and shorting BLUE and BLACK results in the camera focusing, and "
"then you short the GREEN AND BLUE wires and nothing happens but shorting the"
" GREEN AND BLACK results in the camera exposing, then you know that the "
"BLACK wire is ground, GREEN is shutter and BLUE is focus."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** "
"您的导线颜色可能与本示例不同。您可以通过将线缆连接到相机、开机，然后将线缆两两短接来确认哪根线控制哪个功能。例如，如果您有绿色、蓝色和黑色三根导线，将蓝色和黑色短接后相机对焦，然后将绿色和蓝色短接无任何反应，但将绿色和黑色短接后相机曝光，则可以知道黑色是地线、绿色是快门、蓝色是对焦。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:62
#: 40c022a7f9044d9280f133cd7ed93f26 6c35b40808554664a0c5af37168b5ac4
#: 7312619c828041c59388764565fc9d76 b1afc22afbc44c47b280b61686be935a
#: eedf608c2b8d4e9e94fef6c4db4439f6
msgid ""
"Twist the exposed ends of the FOCUS and GROUND wires together then crimp a "
"servo connector to the pair as well as to the exposed end of the SHUTTER "
"wire"
msgstr "将对焦和地线的裸露端拧在一起，然后将舵机连接器压接到这对导线以及快门导线的裸露端"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:70
#: 1f49f688fa984ceb9cd9f93cebd307bb 2c51d2f2f75b4043b81010af935b60ef
#: 3e3bf60644374cf380247e7e44d92ee8 7ed219308cd041a1ab0d213c376ad878
#: 7f07071dfa804a9cb48e97b6d4e100b1
msgid ""
"TIP: The Servo Pin has two sets of tabs which after crimping will fold on "
"each other and secure the wire. To make life a little easier, use a small "
"pair of needle nose pliers to press the pair of tabs on the end of the servo"
" pin tightly against the wires. This will prevent the wires from coming out "
"of the servo pin while trying to crimp them."
msgstr ""
"提示：舵机插针有两组卡扣，压接后会折叠在一起固定导线。为了方便操作，使用小型尖嘴钳将舵机插针末端的一对卡扣紧压在导线上。这将防止导线在压接过程中从舵机插针中滑出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:82
#: 3b5103567fd94c7f9d9a86e403d0ca29 47a93e186b7a40e28aa979e30b9bfa52
#: 6e756dc4297d4b6fa2c66d459fdc9a73 ccecc452ba2a45f19c83da66ebadc9ad
#: f76f7d50085b405788699feb12f71d1b
msgid ""
"Insert the Servo Pins into a Servo connector, one pin on each side of the "
"middle slot of the servo connector."
msgstr "将舵机插针插入舵机连接器，每个插针分别位于舵机连接器中间槽的两侧。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:87
#: 263524c1fe21425d870f7cea3e5adfae 375730686f974be487a3e24192a48cda
#: 61bc0d75dec347f4b8e38980bf334e17 75381c17df0b4511805b76754a632cbc
#: e705860e3e9143bca732a4f1e47ce1e1
msgid ""
"The cable is now ready for connection to your Pixhawk Controller. Note that "
"the Shutter Pin (in this case the RED wire) will be on the SIGNAL side of "
"the Auxiliary port while the WHITE/YELLOW wire will be on the GROUND side of"
" the Auxiliary port."
msgstr ""
"线缆现在已准备好连接到您的 Pixhawk 飞控。请注意，快门插针（本例中为红色导线）将位于辅助端口的信号侧，而白色/黄色导线将位于辅助端口的地线侧。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:95
#: 2198a870391a4c09ad1d0aed6bd288dd 5f316d2cb4ce40b09861a2c65f7466db
#: 8778eeede39849598d1a30921bc56881 a5b3659e308c4bc2adccbdb5a6a1b9e7
#: dbdaa32475ae49d399c7dcf37d1addf1
msgid ""
"**Step 2:** Setting up your  autopilot to trigger your camera via the "
"Shutter Release Cable"
msgstr "**步骤 2：** 设置飞控通过快门释放线触发相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:98
#: 4b55ca3e7fb24788bb0b0390039da876 b2838ea28eaf42069a1c128794d36570
#: d593955648ff44b39f196cdfaf618f1c da5be799d0864e2ba7bf586cd264b987
#: e850bc37fe9f48b0893872a1f1a7c96e
msgid ""
"Connect to your Autopilot via Mission Planner either through direct USB "
"connection or wireless telemetry link."
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 连接到飞控，可通过直接 USB 连接或无线数传链路。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:100
#: 063dedcd3e4b42368d77166c735b2a9a 2150b31184124d17bb118af30e9ad9b8
#: 775a193b3cc248eba89a9d3bb5f79876 9f9e2f07fdc84b368e0564af364c6767
#: aa263a22dcde4e8ab3a646151fd25d33
msgid ""
"Connect your modified shutter release cable to a free GPIO capable pin on "
"the autopilot making sure to maintain the correct orientation for polarity. "
"For example, by default on the Pixhawk, AUX5 or AUX6 is configured to be a "
"GPIO and can be used as a Relay output."
msgstr ""
"将改装后的快门释放线连接到飞控上的空闲 GPIO 引脚，注意保持正确的极性方向。例如，在 Pixhawk 上默认情况下，AUX5 或 AUX6 配置为 "
"GPIO，可用作继电器输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:102
#: 1afbcdaafae54d2198be56516ebc454c 6160ae4e609a4ad6bac77cfbb2027349
#: 651b5789b6b64120bdcbf602067c4672 b9f734b5d19540ef9fa50e45dd66c214
#: d15185b016304c878317ea7740cccaaa
msgid ""
"Connect the shutter release cable to your camera and power the camera on"
msgstr "将快门释放线连接到相机并开机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:107
#: 12a4f6e2b4414636accdbecebe0b4b30 712e9e3e1ba7446a93c67d1fc48294a5
#: 832778bb908b4fd3af92faf82868a80f d535d49b667e4c7fb925245424c3c305
#: ed8e396169cc424c981ed82174192332
msgid ""
"Since we have shorted the FOCUS and GROUND wires, the camera should "
"automatically pull focus. As of now, I have not found a way to connect the "
"SHUTTER, FOCUS and GROUND wires individually to the autopilot and have the "
"autopilot pull the camera focus and trigger the camera in sequence. To get "
"around this, the camera settings are set so that the camera has the "
"following features activated:"
msgstr ""
"由于我们已将对焦和地线短接，相机应会自动进行对焦。到目前为止，我还没有找到将快门、对焦和地线分别连接到飞控并让飞控依次控制相机对焦和触发的方法。为了解决这个问题，相机设置中需激活以下功能："

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:114
#: 1d2c1f4a80aa44ce84f66bc91003d586 4664846832794a14a093a062ba224fa8
#: 47d03e87a37345478714ecdde3907607 ca481a7dd9b242bf9cafdbd7eaca6fc4
#: d6d69fce959748bfb1dddc82feec8940
msgid "Pre-Shutter Focus"
msgstr "快门前对焦"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:116
#: 189e8ef25805497a940a0d5530ab72b8 475dc9f27a9348dfb7ee77e4bf61e6b8
#: 68161e38bf874d63b18a59c618046929 b5dffbc4535b43d888d793ad37a9dcf5
#: bf3b5659e1cc41ba991357f4230fe3a1
msgid "Continuous Auto-Focus"
msgstr "连续自动对焦"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:118
#: 3a5d68e61b214477884a54889360ea0f 3d28898d32284a59a646bc8773d72fcc
#: 7bda905de3b749459450bb54bacc96c4 82495a3f676e41788cd1bab8cfa18c25
#: 8a4858acbf124bd99a5ab7842405d997
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner, navigate to INITIAL SETUP -> CAMERA GIMBAL and change "
"the SHUTTER drop-down menu to “RELAY”"
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 中，导航至 INITIAL SETUP -> CAMERA GIMBAL，将 SHUTTER "
"下拉菜单更改为「RELAY」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:123
#: 12283bd56b2e48068b353ee628da4e7f 3ac80e042a494490bcaeeefe170e0651
#: 3bb5eb9a06d442d6b6d1466449d2b38b 5a2fe49ad597403eb7164c7f4dc06b9b
#: 72498d1497f2470aacbbd5bf9140e229
msgid ""
"NOTE: You can play around with the “Duration” values to increase or decrease"
" the responsiveness of the shutter command. With the Sony A6000, a duration "
"of 1/10\\ :sup:`th` of a Second functions perfectly."
msgstr "注意：您可以调整「Duration」值以增加或减少快门命令的响应速度。对于 Sony A6000，持续时间设为 1/10 秒可完美运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:127
#: 40dc6816e87e45fcae88588a14111bb5 57929859b10a4bf6a23712e554c3b5c1
#: 9c0e5df298a146678fd84fbf9fa016cd bc820d8076b24b2dbf5eba5d001f2ad5
#: c7719b52d3684ccaa9d226c28a4dbf6e
msgid ""
"Proceed to the CONFIG/TUNING -> EXTENDED TUNING screen in Mission Planner "
"and change the CH7 OPT to “Camera Trigger”. This will be necessary if you "
"intend to use your remote controls CH7 to trigger the camera in addition to "
"having the autopilot trigger the camera."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 中进入 CONFIG/TUNING -> EXTENDED TUNING 界面，将 CH7 OPT "
"更改为「Camera Trigger」。如果您打算使用遥控器的 CH7 来触发相机（除了飞控触发之外），这是必要的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:132
#: 00df9a36f20941e3a4e95f45228435de 1e35b951688a43bb9fe12e9f39b2921a
#: 3141b081b40d4688ad5052d2a2ba59db 419e2a796c6d4d02b9f7354df6c1e53e
#: d4bc268689824a6485cdb6b8fc63ee47
msgid ""
"As of 4.0 firmware versions, any GPIO can be assigned as the Camera Trigger "
"pin via its ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` parameter, and any RC channel can be "
"assigned to control that trigger via its ``RCx_OPTION`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"从 4.0 固件版本起，任何 GPIO 都可以通过其 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 参数分配为相机触发引脚，任何 RC 通道都可以通过其 "
"``RCx_OPTION`` 参数分配来控制该触发器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:135
#: 272b555b08664717894c51e01586df7c 413509166b5b439994067114b38f0fb1
#: 5a02cc958e214c7a8e24ebadf7a917d4 6700b29098924da78fbfd66763e9f51c
#: aa357db25b21427b9ada71e6ddfa3a3b
msgid ""
"Navigate to the FULL PARAMETER LIST under the main CONFIG/TUNING tab and "
"locate the ``CAMx_TRIGG_TYPE`` parameter. This parameter must show as 1 for "
"“RELAY”. If it is not set to 1, change this parameter to 1 before proceeding"
" to the next step."
msgstr ""
"在主 CONFIG/TUNING 选项卡下的 FULL PARAMETER LIST 中找到 ``CAMx_TRIGG_TYPE`` "
"参数。此参数必须显示为 1，表示「RELAY」。如果未设置为 1，请在进行下一步之前将此参数更改为 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:140
#: 0093e47bf4a54747ac9facccc1a12a58 1f522e8893464d86b8e7058845cdac89
#: 8aeca0f8adbf4e528c0dcd5ea9432656 9789328fc4424eaa801ceeee12d93eb7
#: feddf4f6e95b485cbfdcf4dbec57472c
msgid ""
"Scroll down through the parameters until you get to ``RELAYx_PIN`` (for the "
"first relay pin...there can be up to 6) . Here you will want to set the "
"``RELAY_PIN``  parameter to match the GPIO pin you have connected the "
"shutter release cable to. Since we have connected the cable to AUX6 on a "
"Pixhawk, we need to change the ``RELAYx_PIN``  parameter to “55” (55:Pixhawk"
" AUXOUT6)."
msgstr ""
"向下滚动参数，直到找到 ``RELAYx_PIN`` （用于第一个继电器引脚……最多可有 6 个）。在这里，您需要将 ``RELAY_PIN`` "
"参数设置为与快门释放线连接的 GPIO 引脚匹配。由于我们将线缆连接到 Pixhawk 的 AUX6，需要将 ``RELAYx_PIN`` "
"参数更改为「55」（55：Pixhawk AUXOUT6）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:145
#: 2631358f8692482a9db48cebfcbc4efd 84a6f3d12abf45c9900909b63c475d29
#: b6acb6af271e4e4ba698884a6500f07a dc3afec7f941437c86e8c16104be4641
#: ffd06b718648491cb7ecfb2f9d489d67
msgid ""
"Now that the required parameters have been changed, click on “WRITE PARAMS”"
msgstr "更改所需参数后，点击「WRITE PARAMS」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:150
#: 1613ac2bd8cf4887a7c75136ce608da1 198711c9d7de4fe1b96e65e58d177c47
#: 6d2f8355822d4cadbf954ce7dfcac715 7a4af76a0d834aa78686525692ebcf2d
#: a3ac5d5923b243b5b8b0d87d068c92bb
msgid "**Step 3:** Testing the Remote Shutter Cable and Autopilot"
msgstr "**步骤 3：** 测试遥控快门线缆和飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:152
#: 0fda53a0718141c2b0bbca3dbeb584a8 11f49ef27ddd4526b2d6e07e171dc300
#: 4350fb2486b4432e9d549af36ebdbce0 5f505897c955452d8b3e6ae294a4645f
#: 69cf33997eff4dce9876d91cb4c430ea
msgid ""
"Now that the cable has been modified and connected to the autopilot which "
"has been setup to trigger the camera via relay, let’s test it."
msgstr "线缆已改装并连接到设置为通过继电器触发相机的飞控，现在让我们进行测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:155
#: 037fa9a060b2405387a85c129122feb4 1e9c06c2b670450bb390be4e8cf47d90
#: 21d05e399a3b4f57a9e12e9ee9850893 3db5a781bc2e412c89d0306504a3a8f8
#: c32b411d597242648ab2f4c84282064d
msgid ""
"Navigate back to the FLIGHT DATA Screen and right click on the map to select"
" “TRIGGER CAMERA NOW”"
msgstr "返回 FLIGHT DATA 界面，右键点击地图选择「TRIGGER CAMERA NOW」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:160
#: 441495aceda647678e80bbdec0f703b8 696e7e16dddf496fb443464d819fdc31
#: 7d5a5ae878a242cf9aaffc7757ff8686 b017f8c435444be19ecb17e40af7ae6b
#: bab91a9f3eb2415b8a87253a15988cbc
msgid ""
"Once clicked, you should hear or see the camera expose. If the camera does "
"not expose, check the following:"
msgstr "点击后，您应该听到或看到相机曝光。如果相机没有曝光，请检查以下内容："

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:163
#: 212ac8c085774616a63d53fce8e2d486 737742fc8a3840cba207a3216e6cf801
#: 9b1516860dfd43cbaa786e0d766bf0ef e2e90e5d758449c18f6ff8cb07ef1e92
#: f97c652b05e04c5bbab72c1f14bcae3c
msgid ""
"Correct Orientation of cables (ie, Shutter Wire is connected to the SIGNAL "
"pin on the correct port of the autopilot and Ground is connected to Ground)"
msgstr "线缆方向是否正确（即快门线连接到飞控正确端口的信号引脚，地线连接到地线）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:164
#: 95c5b770d86647079dc401c9b6ebd301 979496fe81f74a5bb5ae22a295fdd670
#: 9a2e8d72485246bd90966ac00737aa65 a7592543e4ad4e9d91236d28c9fd83a1
#: cb62b3a114f44026b19f22364e732258
msgid "Camera is On and not in an Error State"
msgstr "相机是否已开机且未处于错误状态"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:165
#: 22ff11cc4c7c49a88178b8744030d5b5 2ee325015bbc4cdbbce0b595ae305408
#: 786cccf9fa0943b9ae1571774f0a86ee 98ac6abc939c4487b161a236deb8d860
#: b6f607d9b0554623961def9124ce2996
msgid ""
"Camera lens is not too close to an object which may cause it to be unable to"
" autofocus and expose"
msgstr "相机镜头是否离物体太近，可能导致无法自动对焦和曝光"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:167
#: 36a5c9a508124f10b764f4c512a7e547 4c7fe5ccabb34ac697b3a62121abb120
#: 50f8f74eb9024c08bd5fed8b10a01a02 5a9eb2290f55438d8f3e0c1616b4339c
#: cfe3ddecfbcf4f2eb183ed5af7a3c773
msgid ""
"If you still are not getting the camera to expose and all of the above-"
"mentioned check points are not a problem, then you may want to adjust the "
"Shutter Duration mentioned in Step 2 Part D."
msgstr "如果相机仍无法曝光且上述检查点均无问题，您可能需要调整步骤 2 第 D 部分中提到的快门持续时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup.rst:171
#: 47d668b4fb504aa49fabeaa6c539c517 5177beb6782e4db898e449ff7cba2756
#: 696789d3d83442328199fdfa115f4575 75d9343105494627bb1c5cf8f4e3799b
#: ee42e3fbb74c48e9b28464b98907c712
msgid ""
"If your camera took a picture, congratulations! You are all set to take "
"pictures using the autopilot without needing third party hardware!"
msgstr "如果您的相机成功拍摄了照片，恭喜您！您现在可以使用飞控拍照，无需第三方硬件！"

